- `identification_principle: text` — the formal equation
- `diagnostic(incomplete_triple) → text` — "which primitive is missing?"
- `temporal_triple: PDT_triple` — the P_time, D_time, T_time example
- `UNDERSTAND_EQ: text = "Understand(X) ⟺ Identified(P_X) ∧ Identified(D_X) ∧ Identified(T_X)"`
